                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Analysis of moving to a newly built area at the outskirts of Rotterdam, especially of the financial and social consequences of the people involved. Characteristics of the family / condition of present house / rent / housing benefits / energy costs / most important reason for moving / condition and costs of former home / compensations for moving / differences in rent / rent as a problem for the family budget / experiences with new living situation / surroundings of new home / connections with neighbours. Background variables: occupation/employment/ income/capital assets/ education</p>"
